                    <span id="lblMinimumReqsInClassSpec">You will find the Minimum Requirements in the Class Specification.</span><ul><li><a href='https://hrnet.calhr.ca.gov/CalHRNet/SpecCrossReference.aspx?ClassID=9820' target='_blank'>SUPPORT SERVICES ASSISTANT (INTERPRETER)</a></li></ul>
