                <ul><li><a href='http://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Jobs/JobApplicationPackageChecklist.aspx?JobControlId=417176'>Job Application Package Checklist</a></li><li><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=22387861&name=DS.SSA.Interpreter.0124.pdf'>Duty Statement</a></li></ul>

